OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar                
OL,5,CToday:FRain and hill snow soon         
OL,6,Fclearing from the west. Then it will   
OL,7,Fbe bright with a few showers in the    
OL,8,Fwest, but becoming dry across the east.
OL,10,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry with 
OL,11,Fa frost setting. The rest of the night 
OL,12,Fwill be dry with a widespread frost    
OL,13,Fand a few freezing patches.            
OL,15,CSaturday:FSome early bright in the     
OL,16,Fnorthwest. Otherwise it will be a      
OL,17,Fcloudy and mainly dry day. Rain is     
OL,18,Flikely to spread northeast towards     
OL,19,Fevening.                               
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
